title: "IO-Fortran-Library"
abstract: >-
  A Fortran library for reading and writing text, CSV, binary and NumPy .npy and .npz files,
  converting between numbers and text, and working with strings through a String type,
  written in standard Fortran 2018 with no dependencies.
